{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538958735,"sessionID":"ses_e2d24d448ffeIzsz4Jpv5g585w","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2db6cab001qJMK54JaNSMiby","sessionID":"ses_e2d24d448ffeIzsz4Jpv5g585w","messageID":"msg_1d2db5a94001KlU5qC6MQDIKPL","type":"tool","id":"call_b61045f2843842f6b2168f59","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"includeEmbeddingsHealth\\|includeSemanticHealth\\|^## \\|^### \" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md | tail -60"},"output":"13:## 0. AI-FIRST SETUP GUIDE\n40:## 1. OVERVIEW\n46:## 2. PREREQUISITES\n58:## 3. INSTALLATION\n77:## 4. VERIFICATION\n98:## 5. PACKAGE CHECKS\n117:## 6. RUNTIME HOOKS AND PLUGIN\n139:## 7. COMPAT SHIMS\n168:## 8. ROLLBACK\n199:## 9. OPERATOR CHECKS\n226:### Indexer scan-vs-index counts\n234:## 10. TROUBLESHOOTING\n243:## 11. REFERENCE COMMANDS\n275:## 12. CHOOSING AN EMBEDDER\n279:### 12.1 Current active default\n294:### 12.2 Registered alternatives\n312:### 12.3 Swap mechanism: `'auto'` sentinel + `setActiveEmbedder()`\n338:### 12.4 Operator-safe swap runbook\n350:### 12.5 Device selection\n362:### 12.6 Cross-references\n370:### 12.7 Setup route and cost\n389:## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\n401:## 14. TUNING THE ADVISOR\n405:### 14.1 Quick tuning (no rebuild) — recommended for external clones\n419:### 14.2 Full tuning: `/doctor:skill-advisor tune`\n432:### 14.3 What tuning touches\n442:### 14.4 Tuning rollback\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"13:## 0. AI-FIRST SETUP GUIDE\n40:## 1. OVERVIEW\n46:## 2. PREREQUISITES\n58:## 3. INSTALLATION\n77:## 4. VERIFICATION\n98:## 5. PACKAGE CHECKS\n117:## 6. RUNTIME HOOKS AND PLUGIN\n139:## 7. COMPAT SHIMS\n168:## 8. ROLLBACK\n199:## 9. OPERATOR CHECKS\n226:### Indexer scan-vs-index counts\n234:## 10. TROUBLESHOOTING\n243:## 11. REFERENCE COMMANDS\n275:## 12. CHOOSING AN EMBEDDER\n279:### 12.1 Current active default\n294:### 12.2 Registered alternatives