ills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md` prints at least two lines.\n- [ ] T036 Add one sentence to section 12 saying `includeEmbeddingsHealth` probes the hf-local server only and `includeSemanticHealth` reports the active embedder (`.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md`). Verify: `rg -n \"includeEmbeddingsHealth\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md` prints one line that names hf-local.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '83,90p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/tasks.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538972847,"end":1794538973394}}}}
