{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794539007007,"sessionID":"ses_e2d24d448ffeIzsz4Jpv5g585w","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2dc240a001h52rhgibq74BCC","sessionID":"ses_e2d24d448ffeIzsz4Jpv5g585w","messageID":"msg_1d2dbfde1001cPHiMYh7HIzrov","type":"tool","id":"call_0ca5f4eabcb04a01a5d56c43","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md","oldString":"`--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\n\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:","newString":"`--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost. The two health flags split the diagnosis: `includeEmbeddingsHealth` probes only the hf-local model server, while `includeSemanticHealth` reports the active embedder and probes its backend.\n\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n@@ -368,9 +368,9 @@\n - Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\n \n ### 12.7 Setup route and cost\n \n-`/doctor:install` includes the embedder setup by default, and the setup itself runs as `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from inside the target repo. The route probes `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `advisor_status --include-semantic-health true`, prints one plan row per missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks once before it runs anything. A no stops with `STATUS=CANCELLED` and changes nothing. `--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\n+`/doctor:install` includes the embedder setup by default, and the setup itself runs as `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from inside the target repo. The route probes `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `advisor_status --include-semantic-health true`, prints one plan row per missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks once before it runs anything. A no stops with `STATUS=CANCELLED` and changes nothing. `--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost. The two health flags split the diagnosis: `includeEmbeddingsHealth` probes only the hf-local model server, while `includeSemanticHealth` reports the active embedder and probes its backend.\n \n What the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\n \n | Measure | Value |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\",\"oldString\":\"`--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\\n\\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\",\"newString\":\"`--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost. The two health flags split the diagnosis: `includeEmbeddingsHealth` probes only the hf-local model server, while `includeSemanticHealth` reports the active embedder and probes its backend.\\n\\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\"}"},"time":{"start":1794539004938,"end":1794539007007}}}}
